  "details": "Adding a server option for midwest US, likely hosted out of Chicago, would be a huge improvement to the VRChat experience.\nHosting out of the midwest minimizes latency for the greatest amount of North American players, whether it be east coast, west coast, or anything in between.\nIf this option is added, it should also be the server that US players default to (as opposed to west coast), as, again, this minimizes latency for the greatest amount of players possible.",
